OL,3,GNEWSANo action taken against Iranian
OL,4,Aman who tried to enter nuclear base
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo action is to be taken against an
OL,7,FIranian man who tried to enter the
OL,8,FFaslane nuclear submarine base earlier
OL,9,Fthis year.
OL,11,FThe 34-year-old was arrested at HM
OL,12,FNaval Base Clyde near Helensburgh,
OL,13,FArgyll and Bute, on 19 March, along
OL,14,Fwith a 31-year-old Romanian woman.
OL,16,FThe Crown Office said it had carefully
OL,17,Fconsidered the case and decided there
OL,18,Fshould be no further proceedings
OL,19,Fagainst the man.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
